    <string name="settings_guide_step1_title">1. Downloading Works (Queue Tab):</string>
    <string name="settings_guide_step1_desc">Enter an RJ code (e.g. RJ123456) in the input field, then tap Download or + Queue for continuous automated downloading.</string>
    <string name="settings_guide_step2_title">2. Playing &amp; Managing Collection (Player &amp; Library Tabs):</string>
    <string name="settings_guide_step2_desc">Tap a work in the Library tab to start playing in the Player tab. On the Player tab, tap the playlist icon to view your collection, filter by subfolder, reorder tracks (drag &amp; drop), or move audio between folders.</string>
    <string name="settings_guide_step3_title">3. Floating Mini Player:</string>
    <string name="settings_guide_step3_desc">When audio is playing and you switch to Queue, Library, or Settings tabs, a floating mini player appears above the bottom navigation for quick control.</string>
    <string name="settings_guide_step4_title">4. Sleep Timer:</string>
    <string name="settings_guide_step4_desc">On the player screen, tap the moon icon to set a timer. The countdown automatically pauses when audio playback is paused.</string>
    <string name="settings_guide_step5_title">5. Audio Settings &amp; USB DAC:</string>
    <string name="settings_guide_step5_desc">Use the Settings tab to configure multithreaded download connections, default playback speed, storage directory, and bit-perfect exclusive USB DAC mode.</string>

